{"4841510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Organ Failure", "steam_appid": 4841510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841510/extras/cd57296c1ee5e642efa147ab57f52ec6.poster.avif?t=1787601332\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841510/extras/cd57296c1ee5e642efa147ab57f52ec6.webm?t=1787601332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841510/extras/cd57296c1ee5e642efa147ab57f52ec6.mp4?t=1787601332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A SURGERY, BUT THE MEDIEVAL WAY!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure, being a doctor is hard and all. But it's the <strong>medieval times</strong>! We can just <strong>try bullshit</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face the Doctor</strong> in his game of <strong>Organ Failure</strong>, and show him and the rest of the <strong>Murder</strong> why you deserve to have and manage your own <strong>hospital</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841510/extras/6629493dc0350bc4303465827b70154d.poster.avif?t=1787601332\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841510/extras/6629493dc0350bc4303465827b70154d.webm?t=1787601332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841510/extras/6629493dc0350bc4303465827b70154d.mp4?t=1787601332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMBLE WITH SOMEONE ELSE'S LIFE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ton of <strong>patients</strong>. <strong>Vital</strong> and <strong>Non-Vital</strong> Organs. One of them, the <strong>Sick Organ.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extract one organ per turn, and follow the clues to the <strong>Sickness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't kill the patients!</strong>... Alright, you can <strong>kill some of the patients</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find 3 Sick Organs</strong> before your opponent to win, and crown yourself <strong>the best doctor in the Murder</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841510/extras/b919d93ab1d1177671c69b3bee205ea3.poster.avif?t=1787601332\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841510/extras/b919d93ab1d1177671c69b3bee205ea3.webm?t=1787601332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841510/extras/b919d93ab1d1177671c69b3bee205ea3.mp4?t=1787601332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IT'S THE MEDIEVAL TIMES! MAGIC IS REAL!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, <strong>extracting the heart</strong> will kill your patient, but <strong>that's where the items are</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a LOT of items with unique effects, inspired by both medieval fantasy, and actual medicine from the middle ages (those guys did <u>really weird stuff!</u>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find</strong> the Sick Organ, <strong>Sabotage</strong> your opponent, <strong>Steal</strong> and <strong>Copy</strong> items; <strong>Replace</strong>, <strong>Shuffle</strong>, <strong>Imbue</strong>, <strong>Rematerialize</strong>, <strong>Revitalize</strong>, <strong>Remove</strong>, <strong>Block</strong> and <strong>Alter</strong> each and every organ in the body, and the body itself! <strong>Gamble with your resources</strong>, and see how the Doctor does the same! What a <strong>rapscallion</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841510/extras/b005be531cb64298c3db3ef6503d10fd.poster.avif?t=1787601332\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841510/extras/b005be531cb64298c3db3ef6503d10fd.webm?t=1787601332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841510/extras/b005be531cb64298c3db3ef6503d10fd.mp4?t=1787601332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MANAGE YOUR HOSPITAL AND MEET WEIRD PEOPLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your town has been getting more popular lately. Was it the <strong>Plague</strong>? Maybe your <strong>hospital</strong>? Doubt that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Witch</strong>, a dungeon <strong>Skeleton</strong>, a powerful <strong>Wizard</strong>, and the <strong>King</strong> himself are just some of the characters you'll meet, and each of them add <strong>modifiers</strong> and <strong>requirements</strong> to a game that was already sufficiently hard on its own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taxes</strong>? <strong>Shopping lists</strong>? <strong>Exploding organs</strong>? <strong>A crow with a very cute pink bow</strong>? Things couldn't possibly get any crazier... right?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline 